tations":[{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment10:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment10","raw_text":"黑方平炮别出心裁，反使红车顺利开出，大举进攻，实不如马2进3或马2进1为正。","text":"黑方平炮别出心裁，反使红车顺利开出，大举进攻，实不如马2进3或马2进1为正。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":10,"anchor_node_id":"0:10","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment13:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment13","raw_text":"黑进车贪攻，受到红方严厉的打击，应改走马2进1，还可维持。||如图此时着法极其迅猛，是总攻的开始。","text":"黑进车贪攻，受到红方严厉的打击，应改走马2进1，还可维持。\n如图此时着法极其迅猛，是总攻的开始。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":13,"anchor_node_id":"0:13","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment15:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment15","raw_text":"红三路马借攻车之势迅速投入进攻的行列，是争先夺势的要着。","text":"红三路马借攻车之势迅速投入进攻的行列，是争先夺势的要着。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":15,"anchor_node_id":"0:15","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment20","raw_text":"平炮打卒镇住中路，次序井然，黑以马易炮虽不吃亏，但使左翼防守子力荡然无存，此亦是红方速胜的原因之一。","text":"平炮打卒镇住中路，次序井然，黑以马易炮虽不吃亏，但使左翼防守子力荡然无存，此亦是红方速胜的原因之一。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"0:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment30","raw_text":"红沉底车叫杀，黑方大势已去，现退马挡车亦不过是螳臂挡车。","text":"红沉底车叫杀，黑方大势已去，现退马挡车亦不过是螳臂挡车。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"0:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment39:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment39","raw_text":"红胜。","text":"红胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":39,"anchor_node_id":"0:39","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["061湖南罗忠才 先胜 哈尔滨赵伟"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第二章 顺手炮、列手炮(32局)"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["D26 顺炮直车对横车"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"],"DhtmlXQ_type":["实战全局/开局"]},"source_tag_count":15,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"09192939495969798917770626466